/F2 12 Tf (CHAPTER 2: CONSUMER RIGHTS AND VERIFICATION) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Consumers buying hallmarked gold jewellery are guaranteed exact fineness.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (How to verify HUID:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (1. Download the official 'BIS Care App' on smartphone.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (2. Go to 'Verify HUID' feature.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (3. Enter the 6-digit alphanumeric code engraved on the jewellery item.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (4. The app displays jeweller registration number, AHC details, purity, and date of hallmarking.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (If hallmarked jewellery is found to be of lower purity than marked, the jeweller is liable to pay compensation.) Tj T*
